{"3558770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Harpoon Arena", "steam_appid": 3558770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARPOON ARENA - A 3D TOP-DOWN TEAM  SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies in compact arenas. Direct contact is limited so use the Gripper to <strong>pull enemy</strong> robots from the other side and finish them off with your teammates. Feeling Rambo? <strong>Launch yourself</strong> to the enemy side and <span class=\"bb_strike\">die</span> <strong>WIPE THEM OUT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/7866544f1fe1fec86e42d62ae4a03bab.poster.avif?t=1787253692\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/7866544f1fe1fec86e42d62ae4a03bab.webm?t=1787253692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/7866544f1fe1fec86e42d62ae4a03bab.mp4?t=1787253692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯<strong>PRECISION IS KEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landing a Gripper shot can turn the tide of battle, but don’t forget that your enemies are just as skilled! The battlefield is a chaotic dance of harpoons flying from every direction. <strong>Dodge, strategize, and strike at the perfect moment</strong> to take down your opponents before they take down you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/493e08e310a8497b5b43ee24752e4a8b.poster.avif?t=1787253692\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea